# Reproducible simulation details: keep locally, do not upload.
# Keep config.json, summary.json, verification.json and daily.csv for review.
/results/**/day_[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9].json
/results/**/ledger.csv
/results/**/progress.json

# Deliberately retain source code, reports, original problem attachments,
# final PDF figures and their source data. No global CSV/JSON/PDF exclusion.
